  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\int_0^{1.5}\\left[x^2\\right] d x \\\\ & =\\int_0^1\\left[x^2\\right] d x+\\int_1^{\\sqrt{2}}\\left[x^2\\right] d x+\\int_{\\sqrt{2}}^{3 / 2}\\left[x^2\\right] d x \\\\ & =0+1(\\sqrt{2}-1)+2(1.5-\\sqrt{2}) \\\\ & =2-\\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}$",
